      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing a profound sense of self-erosion, where the familiar quiet has become a cage instead of a sanctuary. That feeling that you've become something separate from your true self is incredibly heavy to carry. Remember that the core of who you are is much broader than the habits or protective routines you've built. Small, gentle nudges toward change can start to remind you of that person underneath the quiet.",
      "source": "target",
